#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Gate Cutting to Reduce Circuit Width"
msgstr "Gate Cutting para Reduzir a Largura do Circuito"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"qiskit-addons/cutting/01_gate_cutting_to_reduce_circuit_width.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this notebook, we will work through the steps of a [Qiskit pattern](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) while using **circuit cutting** to reduce the number of qubits in a circuit.  We will cut gates to enable us to reconstruct the expectation value of a four-qubit circuit using only two-qubit experiments.\n"
msgstr "Neste notebook, percorreremos as etapas de um [padrão Qiskit](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/guides/intro-to-patterns) usando **circuit cutting** para reduzir o número de qubits em um circuito. Vamos cortar portas para nos permitir reconstruir o valor esperado de um circuito de quatro qubits usando apenas experimentos de dois qubits.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These are the steps that we will take:\n"
msgstr "Estas são as etapas que vamos seguir:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 1: Map problem to quantum circuits and operators**:\n"
msgstr "**Etapa 1: Mapear o problema para circuitos quânticos e operadores**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map the hamiltonian onto a quantum circuit.\n"
msgstr "Mapear o hamiltoniano em um circuito quântico.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 2: Optimize for target hardware** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Etapa 2: Otimizar para o hardware alvo** [_Usa o cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cut the circuit and observable.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Cortar o circuito e o observável.</font>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments for hardware.\n"
msgstr "Transpilar os subexperimentos para o hardware.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 3: Execute on target hardware**:\n"
msgstr "**Etapa 3: Executar no hardware alvo**:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments obtained in Step 2 using a `Sampler` primitive.\n"
msgstr "Executar os subexperimentos obtidos na Etapa 2 usando uma primitiva `Sampler`.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Step 4: Post-process results** [_Uses the cutting addon_]:\n"
msgstr "**Etapa 4: Pós-processar os resultados** [_Usa o cutting addon_]:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, no-wrap
msgid "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combine the results of Step 3 to reconstruct the expectation value of the observable in question.</font>\n"
msgstr "<font color='#0F62FE'>Combinar os resultados da Etapa 3 para reconstruir o valor esperado do observável em questão.</font>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1: Map {#step-1-map}"
msgstr "Etapa 1: Mapear {#step-1-map}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a circuit to cut {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"
msgstr "Crie um circuito para cortar {#create-a-circuit-to-cut}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama de circuito quântico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_1.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specify an observable {#specify-an-observable}"
msgstr "Especifique um observável {#specify-an-observable}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2: Optimize {#step-2-optimize}"
msgstr "Etapa 2: Otimizar {#step-2-optimize}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separate the circuit and observable according to a specified qubit partitioning {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-qubit-partitioning}"
msgstr "Separe o circuito e o observável de acordo com um particionamento de qubits especificado {#separate-the-circuit-and-observable-according-to-a-specified-qubit-partitioning}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each label in `partition_labels` corresponds to the `circuit` qubit in the same index. Qubits sharing a common partition label will be grouped together, and non-local gates spanning more than one partition will be cut.\n"
msgstr "Cada rótulo em `partition_labels` corresponde ao qubit do `circuit` no mesmo índice. Qubits que compartilham um rótulo de partição comum serão agrupados, e portas não locais que abrangem mais de uma partição serão cortadas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Note:** The ``observables`` kwarg to `partition_problem` is of type `PauliList`. Observable term coefficients and phases are ignored during decomposition of the problem and execution of the subexperiments. They may be re-applied during reconstruction of the expectation value.\n"
msgstr "**Nota:** O kwarg ``observables`` de `partition_problem` é do tipo `PauliList`. Os coeficientes e fases dos termos do observável são ignorados durante a decomposição do problema e a execução dos subexperimentos. Eles podem ser reaplicados durante a reconstrução do valor esperado.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Visualize the decomposed problem {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"
msgstr "Visualize o problema decomposto {#visualize-the-decomposed-problem}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama de circuito quântico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_2.png)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Quantum circuit diagram](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"
msgstr "![Diagrama de circuito quântico](/img/qiskit-addons/cutting/01-gate-cutting-to-reduce-circuit-width/output_3.png)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Calculate the sampling overhead for the chosen cuts {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"
msgstr "Calcule o sampling overhead para os cortes escolhidos {#calculate-the-sampling-overhead-for-the-chosen-cuts}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we cut two CNOT gates, resulting in a sampling overhead of $9^2$.\n"
msgstr "Aqui cortamos duas portas CNOT, resultando em um sampling overhead de $9^2$.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For more on the sampling overhead incurred by circuit cutting, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Para mais detalhes sobre o sampling overhead incorrido pelo circuit cutting, consulte o [material explicativo](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generate the subexperiments to run on the backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"
msgstr "Gere os subexperimentos para executar no backend {#generate-the-subexperiments-to-run-on-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`generate_cutting_experiments` accepts `circuits`/`observables` args as dictionaries mapping qubit partition labels to the respective `subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"
msgstr "`generate_cutting_experiments` aceita os argumentos `circuits`/`observables` como dicionários que mapeiam rótulos de partição de qubits para os respectivos `subcircuit`/`subobservables`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To simulate the expectation value of the full-sized circuit, many subexperiments are generated from the decomposed gates' joint quasiprobability distribution and then executed on one or more backends. The number of samples taken from the distribution is controlled by `num_samples`, and one combined coefficient is given for each unique sample. For more information on how the coefficients are calculated, refer to the [explanatory material](../explanation/index.rst).\n"
msgstr "Para simular o valor esperado do circuito de tamanho completo, muitos subexperimentos são gerados a partir da distribuição de quasiprobabilidade conjunta das portas decompostas e então executados em um ou mais backends. O número de amostras retiradas da distribuição é controlado por `num_samples`, e um coeficiente combinado é dado para cada amostra única. Para mais informações sobre como os coeficientes são calculados, consulte o [material explicativo](../explanation/index.rst).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Choose a backend {#choose-a-backend}"
msgstr "Escolha um backend {#choose-a-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here we are using a fake backend, which will result in Qiskit Runtime running in local mode (i.e., on a local simulator).\n"
msgstr "Aqui estamos usando um backend simulado (fake), o que fará com que o Qiskit Runtime seja executado em modo local (ou seja, em um simulador local).\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the subexperiments for the backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"
msgstr "Prepare os subexperimentos para o backend {#prepare-the-subexperiments-for-the-backend}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We must transpile the circuits with our backend as the target before submitting them to Qiskit Runtime.\n"
msgstr "Devemos transpilar os circuitos com nosso backend como alvo antes de submetê-los ao Qiskit Runtime.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3: Execute {#step-3-execute}"
msgstr "Etapa 3: Executar {#step-3-execute}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the subexperiments using the Qiskit Runtime Sampler primitive {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"
msgstr "Execute os subexperimentos usando a primitiva Sampler do Qiskit Runtime {#run-the-subexperiments-using-the-qiskit-runtime-sampler-primitive}"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4: Post-process {#step-4-post-process}"
msgstr "Etapa 4: Pós-processar {#step-4-post-process}"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct the expectation value {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"
msgstr "Reconstrua o valor esperado {#reconstruct-the-expectation-value}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reconstruct expectation values for each observable term and combine them to reconstruct the expectation value for the original observable.\n"
msgstr "Reconstrua os valores esperados para cada termo do observável e combine-os para reconstruir o valor esperado do observável original.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the reconstructed expectation value with the exact expectation value from the original circuit and observable {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"
msgstr "Compare o valor esperado reconstruído com o valor esperado exato do circuito e observável originais {#compare-the-reconstructed-expectation-value-with-the-exact-expectation-value-from-the-original-circuit-and-observable}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
msgstr "<TutorialFeedback />\n"
